{"title":"Career roadmap · Software Developer","role":"Software Developer","summary":"A Software Developer designs, builds, tests, deploys and maintains software applications. A General BCA provides a strong entry route when combined with programming, data structures, databases, software engineering, projects and practical development experience.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BCA (Bachelor of Computer Applications)","Course":"General BCA","Timeline assumption":"3-year BCA beginning in 2026 → graduation around 2029. If enrolled in a 4-year honours/research structure, use 2030 as the graduation target."},"about":[{"label":"Alignment","text":"Direct"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Software Developer designs, builds, tests, deploys and maintains software applications. A General BCA provides a strong entry route when combined with programming, data structures, databases, software engineering, projects and practical development experience."}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BCA","Programming + DSA","Projects","Internship","Junior Software Developer","Software Developer","Senior Developer","Lead/Architect"]},{"type":"p","text":"A BCA can lead directly to software-development jobs. Strong programming ability and demonstrable projects often matter more than the degree title alone for entry-level private-sector roles."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2029/30"},{"text":"Build programming, DSA, databases, web/backend development, Git and software-engineering fundamentals."}],[{"text":"2029–2034"},{"text":"Become a strong production developer and specialise in backend, frontend, full stack, mobile, cloud or another area."}],[{"text":"2034–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Developer, Tech Lead, Staff Engineer or specialised engineering roles."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward Principal Engineer, Architect, Engineering Manager, technical leadership or entrepreneurship."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Programming fundamentals"},{"text":"C/Java/Python"},{"text":"20+ small programs"},{"text":"Coding foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"OOP + Git"},{"text":"Java/Python + Git"},{"text":"GitHub projects"},{"text":"Engineering habits"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"DSA"},{"text":"Arrays, trees, graphs, algorithms"},{"text":"100+ quality problems"},{"text":"Problem solving"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"DBMS + web"},{"text":"SQL, HTML/CSS/JS"},{"text":"CRUD application"},{"text":"Application development"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Backend/full stack"},{"text":"APIs, frameworks, authentication"},{"text":"Production-style application"},{"text":"Job readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Cloud + DevOps + interviews"},{"text":"Docker, CI/CD, cloud"},{"text":"Deployed project + internship"},{"text":"Employability"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced engineering"},{"text":"System design, distributed systems"},{"text":"Scalable application"},{"text":"Engineering depth"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Cloud/AI/security/mobile etc."},{"text":"Capstone + placement"},{"text":"Career differentiation"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects to prioritise"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Object-Oriented Programming"},{"text":"Data Structures & Algorithms"},{"text":"Database Management Systems"},{"text":"Operating Systems"},{"text":"Computer Networks"},{"text":"Software Engineering"},{"text":"Web Technologies"},{"text":"Computer Architecture"},{"text":"Discrete Mathematics"},{"text":"Computer Organisation"},{"text":"Information Security"},{"text":"Cloud Computing"},{"text":"Mobile Application Development"},{"text":"Artificial Intelligence fundamentals"},{"text":"Software Testing"},{"text":"Project Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Java"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"JavaScript/TypeScript"},{"text":"C/C++ basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Backend"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Spring Boot"},{"text":"Node.js/Express"},{"text":"FastAPI"},{"text":"REST APIs"},{"text":"Authentication/authorisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Frontend"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTML"},{"text":"CSS"},{"text":"JavaScript"},{"text":"React"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Databases"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"MySQL"},{"text":"MongoDB"},{"text":"Redis fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"CI/CD"},{"text":"Testing"},{"text":"Debugging"},{"text":"Logging"},{"text":"API design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS/Azure/GCP fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful official learning resources include Python documentation, Git documentation, Spring Boot and MDN Web Docs.","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/"},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio target"},{"type":"h","text":"By graduation, aim for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DSA repository"},{"text":"Full-stack web application"},{"text":"Java/Spring Boot backend"},{"text":"REST API project"},{"text":"Database-heavy application"},{"text":"Cloud-deployed project"},{"text":"One team/open-source project"},{"text":"One substantial final-year project"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Every major project should demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git history"},{"text":"README"},{"text":"Architecture diagram"},{"text":"API documentation"},{"text":"Tests"},{"text":"Database design"},{"text":"Deployment"},{"text":"Error handling"},{"text":"Security basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Java Backend"},{"text":"Java, Spring Boot, PostgreSQL, Docker"},{"text":"Enterprise applications"},{"text":"Senior Backend Engineer"}],[{"text":"Full Stack"},{"text":"React, TypeScript, Spring/Node, SQL"},{"text":"Product development"},{"text":"Senior Full Stack Engineer"}],[{"text":"Python Backend"},{"text":"Python, FastAPI/Django, PostgreSQL"},{"text":"APIs + automation"},{"text":"Senior Python Engineer"}],[{"text":"Frontend"},{"text":"React, TypeScript, Next.js"},{"text":"Web applications"},{"text":"Senior Frontend Engineer"}],[{"text":"Cloud/DevOps"},{"text":"Linux, Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform"},{"text":"Cloud infrastructure"},{"text":"DevOps/Platform Engineer"}],[{"text":"Mobile"},{"text":"Kotlin/Android or Flutter"},{"text":"Mobile development"},{"text":"Mobile Engineer"}],[{"text":"AI/ML Engineering"},{"text":"Python, ML, APIs, MLOps"},{"text":"AI products"},{"text":"ML/AI Engineer"}],[{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Linux, networks, security, Python"},{"text":"Secure systems"},{"text":"Security Engineer"}],[{"text":"Data Engineering"},{"text":"SQL, Python, Spark, cloud"},{"text":"Data platforms"},{"text":"Data Engineer"}],[{"text":"QA Automation"},{"text":"Java/Python, Selenium/Playwright, CI/CD"},{"text":"Automated testing"},{"text":"SDET/Test Engineer"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"For a General BCA student who wants maximum software-development opportunities:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Java","Spring Boot","SQL","React","DSA","Git","Docker","AWS"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"is a strong full-stack/enterprise route."},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and stay relevant, 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Software development will increasingly involve AI-assisted coding, cloud-native architecture, distributed systems, cybersecurity, automation and platform engin