am project."}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification/course","Cost","When","Why it helps"],"rows":[[{"text":"AWS Cloud Practitioner"},{"text":"Paid exam; current fee: check the official site"},{"text":"Year 2–3"},{"text":"Cloud foundation"}],[{"text":"AWS Developer/Associate-level certification"},{"text":"Paid exam;"},{"text":"Year 3+"},{"text":"Cloud development"}],[{"text":"Microsoft Azure fundamentals"},{"text":"Paid/free learning; exam fee: check the official site"},{"text":"Year 2–3"},{"text":"Cloud foundation"}],[{"text":"Docker"},{"text":"Free learning/paid certification options"},{"text":"Year 2–3"},{"text":"Containerisation"}],[{"text":"Kubernetes"},{"text":"Free learning/paid certification options"},{"text":"Year 3+"},{"text":"Cloud-native skills"}],[{"text":"SQL certification/course"},{"text":"Free/paid"},{"text":"Year 1–2"},{"text":"Database skills"}],[{"text":"Git/GitHub training"},{"text":"Free"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Version control"}],[{"text":"Java/Spring Boot training"},{"text":"Free/paid"},{"text":"Year 2–3"},{"text":"Backend development"}],[{"text":"Cloud DevOps training"},{"text":"Free/paid"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Deployment skills"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Use AWS Certification and Microsoft Credentials for current certification information."},{"type":"flow","items":["Projects","DSA","internship > collecting certificates."],"sep":"+","label":"Priority"}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"First-job targets"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Software Developer"},{"text":"Software Engineer"},{"text":"Junior Software Developer"},{"text":"Associate Software Engineer"},{"text":"Graduate Software Engineer"},{"text":"Full Stack Developer"},{"text":"Java Developer"},{"text":"Backend Developer"},{"text":"Python Developer"},{"text":"Frontend Developer"},{"text":"Web Developer"},{"text":"Application Developer"},{"text"